AGENTS.md — [Project] (Symfony 7)
Purpose · Stack

PHP 8.3 · Symfony 7 · Doctrine ORM · Twig · PHPUnit · PHPStan · PhpCsFixer
Map & flow

    src/Controller/* — thin controllers
    src/Service/ (or src/Domain/) — business logic
    src/Entity/ + src/Repository/ — Doctrine layer
    config/packages/, config/routes/ · templates/ (Twig) · tests/
    Flow: request → controller → service → repository → Doctrine → MySQL

Commands

    composer install · symfony serve · cache:clear
    routes: php bin/console debug:router
    migrations: php bin/console doctrine:migrations:diff && doctrine:migrations:migrate
    test one: php bin/phpunit --filter=Name
    types: vendor/bin/phpstan analyse --level=8

Hard rules (NEVER)

    never edit vendor/ or var/ (regenerated)
    Doctrine migrations only via bin/console — never edit applied ones
    never commit .env.local

