AGENTS.md — [Project]
Purpose · Stack

PHP 8.x · [Slim 4 / no framework] · PDO · PHPUnit · PHPStan
Map & flow

    public/index.php — front controller (all requests enter here)
    src/ — PSR-4 via composer.json
    src/Controllers/ · src/Domain/ · src/Infrastructure/
