    composer install · serve: php -S localhost:8000 -t public
    test one: vendor/bin/phpunit --filter=Name
    types: vendor/bin/phpstan analyse src --level=8

Conventions

strict_types · final · DTOs · prepared statements everywhere
Hard rules (NEVER)

    never concatenate SQL; never commit .env; no logic in index.php beyondbootstrap/routing

